mowis-desktop-environment (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fork from ukui-desktop-environment
  * Rebrand to MOWIS (Mobile-Optimized Workspace Interface Shell)
  * Add Samsung DeX-inspired GSettings defaults
  * Replace ukui-ubuntu.gschema.override with mowis.gschema.override
  * Add DeX keyboard shortcuts (Super+arrows snap, Super+1-4 workspaces)
  * Add picom, rofi, dunst, kvantum to core dependencies
  * Set ukui-black + Papirus-Dark as default theme
  * Set Noto Sans as default font family
  * Disable telemetry and crash reporting by default
  * Enable edge-tiling by default
  * Set panel position to top (DeX taskbar style)

 -- MOWIS Project <mowis-dev@proton.me>  Fri, 20 Mar 2026 23:25:08 +0700
